172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Advancements in chatbot technology have demonstrated the potential to improve accessibility and convenience for pet owners. Platforms like Woof.AI offer personalized product recommendations to enhance user experiences \(Woof.AI, 2024\). Similarly, AI-powered veterinary chatbots support scheduling, answer frequently asked questions, and manage reminders for vaccinations, providing round-the-clock assistance \(FastBots, 2024\). Building on these innovations, FurBot offers a user-friendly and efficient platform that provides real-time assistance through predefined questions and answers, supported by NLP. It ensures users receive accurate, personalized, and location-specific recommendations, meeting a wide range of needs, including finding pet-friendly spaces, accessing essential services, and addressing process-related queries like traveling with pets.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
